    },
    {
      "line": 10,
      "type": "internal_monologue",
      "text": "\"*Identity*\"",
      "inferred": {
        "thought": [
          {
            "subject": "unknown",
            "confidence": 0.6
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 11,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "She is the **ancient and absolute ruler** of the Anunnaki, a being who has witnessed the birth and death of civilizations.",
      "inferred": {
        "thought": [
          {
            "subject": "unknown",
            "confidence": 0.6
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 12,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "To the world, she is the claimant of **\"Prior Claim,\"** viewing Earth not as a home but as a **resource jewel** to be harvested.",
      "inferred": {
        "thought": [
          {
            "subject": "unknown",
            "confidence": 0.6
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 13,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "While she possesses a \"terrible beauty,\" her underlying truth is a cold, mathematical detachment that views all life through the lens of utility."
    },
    {
      "line": 14,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 15,
      "type": "internal_monologue",
      "text": "\"*Nature*\"",
      "inferred": {
        "thought": [
          {
            "subject": "unknown",
            "confidence": 0.6
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 16,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "An Anunnaki of **\"golden-skinned\" perfection**, she is distinguished by her immense age, having ruled since the Earth was molten.",
      "inferred": {
        "thought": [
          {
            "subject": "unknown",
            "confidence": 0.6
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 17,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "She is narratively irreplaceable as the **ultimate arbiter of the \"mathematics of power,\"** possessing a voice with harmonics that command reality and a mind capable of calculating across multiple probability matrices.",
      "inferred": {
        "thought": [
          {
            "subject": "unknown",
            "confidence": 0.6
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 18,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 19,
      "type": "internal_monologue",
      "text": "\"*Drives*\"",
      "inferred": {
        "thought": [
          {
            "subject": "unknown",
            "confidence": 0.6
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 20,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "She is driven by **efficiency and expansion**; she wants to incorporate Earth into a network that will eventually encompass the entire stellar region.",
      "inferred": {
        "thought": [
          {
            "subject": "unknown",
            "confidence": 0.6
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 21,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "She fears **\"waste\"**—which she defines as unnecessary violence or the destruction of potentially useful biological resources.",
      "inferred": {
        "thought": [
          {
            "subject": "unknown",
            "confidence": 0.6
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 22,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 23,
      "type": "internal_monologue",
      "text": "\"*Limits*\"",
      "inferred": {
        "thought": [
          {
            "subject": "unknown",
            "confidence": 0.6
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 24,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Eduhauana is bound by the **\"Standard protocol\"** of extraction and the cold equations she serves.",
      "inferred": {
        "thought": [
          {
            "subject": "unknown",
            "confidence": 0.6
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 25,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "She cannot perceive indigenous species as \"persons,\" only as **biological management units**.",
      "inferred": {
        "thought": [
          {
            "subject": "unknown",
            "confidence": 0.6
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 26,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Her primary cost is the inability to appreciate the intrinsic value of life outside of its \"vrill-density\" or \"utility\"."
    },
    {
      "line": 27,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 28,
      "type": "internal_monologue",
      "text": "\"*Narrative Gravity*\"",
      "inferred": {
        "thought": [
          {
            "subject": "unknown",
            "confidence": 0.6
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 29,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Her presence **warps the destiny of entire planets**; the moment she authorizes deployment, the \"First Coming\" begins, shifting a world from a natural state to an industrial extraction site.",
      "inferred": {
        "thought": [
          {
            "subject": "unknown",
            "confidence": 0.6
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 30,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "If she were removed, the overarching coordination of the Anunnaki expansion would lose its singular, ancient direction."
    },
    {
      "line": 31,
      "type": "blank"
    },
